.TH IANOX 1 "November 2026" "ianox 0.0.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ianox \- local AI gateway, model manager and coding agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ianox
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ianox
is a desktop application that brings three things together: a local gateway that can route
requests across AI providers, a manager for local and cloud models, and a chat with a coding
agent that works inside a project folder.
.PP
It is
.B pre-alpha
software. Expect rough edges, missing features and changes between versions.
.PP
.B ianox
takes no command-line options. Starting it a second time brings the window of the running
instance to the front instead of opening another one. The tray icon keeps the gateway
reachable while the window is closed.
.SH THE AGENT AND YOUR FILES
The agent can read files and, in
.I build
mode, edit files and run shell commands. It is confined as follows:
.IP \(bu 2
Writing and editing are only allowed inside the project folder.
.IP \(bu 2
Shell commands ask for confirmation (you can allow them for the rest of a conversation). When
.BR bwrap (1)
is installed they run in a sandbox where everything outside the project folder (and
.IR /tmp )
is read-only. Without it, commands run unsandboxed and the confirmation says so.
.IP \(bu 2
Reading outside the project needs your permission, unless you wrote the path in your own
message or attached the file. Private locations such as
.I ~/.ssh
ask every time, even if you named them.
.PP
The
.I plan
mode is read-only.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ianox/config.json
Providers (including API keys, stored as plain text), routes, agents, projects and interface
settings. Create it by using the application; edit it only while ianox is closed.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ianox/sessions.json
Saved conversations.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ianox/usage.jsonl
One line per model request: tokens, latency and the conversation it belongs to.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ianox/pricing.json
Price per million tokens used to estimate cost. Editable.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ianox/models-cache-v2.json
Cache of the model catalogue downloaded from models.dev (refreshed daily).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/io.github.subdes.ianox/
Window position and size.
.PP
Choices made in the interface such as fonts, favorite models and the open tabs are kept in the
local storage of the application's web view.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base directory for the configuration files above. Defaults to
.IR ~/.config .
.TP
.B SHELL
Shell started in the integrated terminal.
.SH NETWORK
ianox does not send telemetry. It connects only to:
.IP \(bu 2
The AI providers you configure, with the credentials you give it.
.IP \(bu 2
https://models.dev, to download the model catalogue.
.IP \(bu 2
Whatever the agent's commands or the integrated browser are asked to reach.
.PP
When the gateway is enabled it listens on
.I 127.0.0.1:20128
by default. Its chat endpoint supports streaming only at this stage; other endpoints return
501 until implemented.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bwrap (1)
